    "assignment": {
     "title": "Assignment — Examining the Suffering Servant",
     "text": "Read Isaiah 52:13–53:12, Mark 10:45, Luke 22:37, and Acts 8:26–35.\nPrepare a written study containing:\n1. A description of the servant's suffering in Isaiah.\n2. An explanation of the passage's references to the sins and suffering of others.\n3. A comparison between Isaiah's description and Jesus' statement in Mark 10:45.\n4. An examination of Jesus' reference to being numbered with transgressors in Luke 22:37.\n5. A description of how Philip used Isaiah's passage when explaining Jesus to the Ethiopian official.\n6. A reflection on the relationship between service, suffering, justice, and redemption.\nConclude by explaining how the suffering servant passage contributes to the Christian understanding of the Messiah's mission."
    }
