   "1.\tExplain the meaning and significance of the name Jesus.",
   "2.\tDescribe the message Joseph received in his dream.",
   "3.\tExplain Matthew 1:21 in your own words.",
   "4.\tDiscuss the difference between Jesus' saving mission and the pursuit of temporary earthly success.",
   "5.\tExplain why the birth of Jesus must be considered in the light of His wider mission.",
   "Part 5 — Mary's Question and God's Answer",
   "Read Luke 1:34–37.",
   "1.\tExplain Mary's question.",
   "2.\tDescribe Gabriel's answer concerning the Holy Spirit.",
   "3.\tExplain the significance of Elizabeth's pregnancy in Gabriel's response.",
   "4.\tDiscuss the meaning of Luke 1:37 within its context.",
   "5.\tExplain how a person can ask sincere questions while remaining willing to learn and respond in faith.",
   "Part 6 — Faith, Humility, and Obedience",
   "Read Luke 1:38–55.",
   "1.\tWrite Mary's response to Gabriel in your own words.",
   "2.\tIdentify three qualities demonstrated by Mary's response.",
   "3.\tExplain the significance of Mary's visit to Elizabeth.",
   "4.\tIdentify three major themes in Mary's song of praise.",
