   "1.\tExplain Joseph's initial dilemma.",
   "2.\tWhat does Matthew reveal about Joseph's character?",
   "3.\tWhat instructions did the angel give Joseph?",
   "4.\tHow did Joseph respond after receiving the message?",
   "5.\tIdentify two lessons from Joseph's actions that can help people make difficult decisions responsibly.",
   "Part 8 — Biblical Connections",
   "Complete the following table using the cited passages.",
