   "2 Samuel 7:12–162 Samuel 7:12–16\tGod's promise concerning David's house and kingdomGod's promise concerning David's house and kingdom\tExplain the connection to Jesus' promised reign.Explain the connection to Jesus' promised reign.",
   "Isaiah 7:14Isaiah 7:14\tThe sign involving a child called ImmanuelThe sign involving a child called Immanuel\tExplain how Matthew connects this prophecy to Jesus.Explain how Matthew connects this prophecy to Jesus.",
   "Isaiah 9:6–7Isaiah 9:6–7\tThe promised child and enduring kingdomThe promised child and enduring kingdom\tIdentify the characteristics of the coming ruler.Identify the characteristics of the coming ruler.",
   "Micah 5:2Micah 5:2\tBethlehem and the coming rulerBethlehem and the coming ruler\tExplain the significance of Bethlehem in the biblical story.Explain the significance of Bethlehem in the biblical story.",
   "Luke 1:26–38Luke 1:26–38\tGabriel's announcement to MaryGabriel's announcement to Mary\tSummarize the announcement and Mary's response.Summarize the announcement and Mary's response.",
   "Matthew 1:18–25Matthew 1:18–25\tJoseph's dream and obedienceJoseph's dream and obedience\tExplain Joseph's role in the events surrounding Jesus' birth.Explain Joseph's role in the events surrounding Jesus' birth.",
   "Luke 1:46–55Luke 1:46–55\tMary's song of praiseMary's song of praise\tIdentify what Mary's words reveal about God's character.Identify what Mary's words reveal about God's character.",
   "Luke 2:8–14Luke 2:8–14\tThe angel's announcement to the shepherdsThe angel's announcement to the shepherds\tExplain how the message confirms the significance of Jesus' birth.Explain how the message confirms the significance of Jesus' birth.",
   "Part 9 — Practical Application",
   "Answer the following questions thoughtfully.",
   "1.\tWhat should a person do when a new responsibility changes their plans?",
   "2.\tHow can you respond when you believe you should do something right but fear how others may react?",
   "3.\tWhat is one practical way to demonstrate humility in your daily life?",
