   "Closing Prayer",
   "Heavenly Father,",
   "Thank You for Your faithfulness and for the promises You have fulfilled through Jesus Christ. Thank You for the story of Gabriel's visit to Mary, which reminds us that Your purposes are greater than our understanding and that Your timing is not limited by human expectations.",
   "Lord, teach us to trust You when we face uncertainty. Give us hearts that are humble enough to listen, courage to respond to what is right, and wisdom to seek understanding when we have questions.",
   "Help us learn from Mary's willingness to serve You and from Joseph's decision to act according to the guidance he received. Teach us to treat others with compassion, especially when their circumstances are difficult or misunderstood.",
   "May we never measure our worth by wealth, status, popularity, or earthly recognition. Help us understand that faithful service, humility, and obedience matter in Your kingdom.",
