    "assignment": {
     "title": "Assignment — Examining Righteous Character",
     "text": "Read Matthew 1:19, Micah 6:8, and Psalm 15:1–5.\n1. Identify the qualities associated with righteous conduct in these passages.\n2. Explain how Joseph's proposed quiet separation reflects concern for Mary's dignity.\n3. Compare the biblical idea of righteousness with simply wanting to look good in public.\n4. Describe a practical situation in which justice and mercy must be considered together.\n5. Write a personal commitment identifying one character quality you want to develop and one action through which you will practise it."
    }
