     "text": "Write a personal reflection of 300–400 words addressing the following:\n1. Identify one area of your life in which you want to grow spiritually.\n2. Explain what you already know from Scripture about that area.\n3. Identify one practical action you can take this week.\n4. Describe two distractions that could prevent you from following through.\n5. Write a short prayer asking God to help you seek Him sincerely."
