     "Waiting can be difficult. People may begin to doubt when a promise seems delayed or when circumstances do not match their expectations. Yet the biblical story encourages us to consider God's faithfulness across the wider history of Scripture.",
     "The wise men had arrived in Jerusalem looking for a King. Through the Scriptures, they received a more precise direction: Bethlehem.",
