     "Allow Your Thinking to Be Renewed.\nRomans 12:2 teaches that transformation involves the renewal of the mind. Study Scripture, examine your attitudes, and practise thinking in ways that reflect truth, wisdom, and love.",
     "Continue Walking Faithfully After a Significant Experience.\nThe wise men's journey did not end with the moment of worship; they still had to return home. Spiritual growth continues in ordinary life, through repeated decisions to follow what is right."
