   "9. Review the decision when new information emerges.",
   "Apply the guide to a realistic scenario involving a family that must reconsider its living arrangements because of a safety concern.",
   "Explain how responsible planning, courage, discernment, and concern for others should influence the decision.",
   "Part 6 — Seven-Day Practical Application Project",
   "Apply one lesson from the topic each day for seven consecutive days.",
   "At the end of each day, record:",
   "•\tWhat you did.",
   "•\tWhat you learned.",
