   "Part 7 — Final Personal Reflection",
   "Write a final essay of 800–1,200 words titled:",
   "“Faithful Through Uncertainty: What Joseph's Journey Teaches Me.”",
   "Your essay should address:",
   "1. What Joseph's response to the angel's warning teaches about obedience.",
   "2. Why protecting others is an important responsibility.",
   "3. What the family's stay in Egypt teaches about waiting.",
   "4. What Herod's actions reveal about fear, power, and cruelty.",
   "5. How the biblical account presents grief and suffering.",
