   "Closing Prayer",
   "Heavenly Father,",
   "Thank You for Your Word and for the account of Joseph, Mary, and Jesus during a time of danger and uncertainty.",
   "Thank You for reminding us that Your purposes continued even when human beings acted with cruelty and selfish ambition. Help us to understand this truth without minimising the suffering of innocent people or treating injustice as something unimportant.",
   "Lord, give us hearts that are willing to obey what is right. Teach us to listen carefully, seek wisdom, and act responsibly when we face difficult decisions. Help us recognise when we need to change our plans, leave an unsafe situation, seek trustworthy counsel, or take practical steps to protect those entrusted to our care.",
   "Protect children, vulnerable people, and families experiencing danger or displacement. Give wisdom and compassion to those responsible for caring for others. Strengthen communities to stand against abuse, dishonesty, cruelty, and the misuse of authority.",
   "Father, help us recognise the destructive effects of fear, pride, jealousy, and the desire for control. Teach us to use whatever influence we have with humility, justice, and compassion. May we never place personal ambition above the well-being of others.",
   "When we experience seasons of uncertainty, teach us to wait patiently while continuing to fulfil our responsibilities. When circumstances change, give us discernment to reassess our decisions. When we do not understand everything that is happening, help us remain faithful without pretending that every painful question has an easy answer.",
   "Teach us to care for those who grieve. Give us compassionate words, willing hands, and the wisdom to support people in ways that respect their needs and dignity.",
   "Thank You for the example of Joseph, who responded to the instructions he received and continued caring for his family through changing circumstances. Help us demonstrate similar faithfulness in our own responsibilities.",
   "May we grow in wisdom, courage, patience, and love. Guide our decisions, strengthen our character, and help us remain faithful in both difficult seasons and ordinary daily life.",
