     "text": "Prepare a written reflection of 400–500 words explaining how people can respond compassionately to suffering.\nInclude:\n1. What Matthew 2:16–18 reveals about the grief caused by Herod's command.\n2. The significance of Jeremiah's image of Rachel weeping.\n3. Four practical ways to support a grieving person.\n4. Three ways communities can strengthen the protection of children and vulnerable people.\n5. A reflection on why compassion should involve both words and actions."
