     "Ask Questions with a Genuine Desire to Learn.\nThoughtful questions can uncover assumptions, clarify difficult ideas, and deepen understanding.",
     "Think Before You Speak.\nA good response requires attention to the question and consideration of the available information. Speaking quickly is not always a sign of wisdom.",
     "Learning Is an Active Process.\nListening, asking questions, reasoning, and responding are complementary activities. Effective learners use all of them.",
