     "Spiritual Change Must Affect Daily Conduct.\nJohn's instructions concerned sharing, honesty, and the use of authority. Our faith should influence how we treat people at home, school, work, and in public life.",
     "Integrity Matters in Ordinary Work.\nJohn challenged tax collectors and soldiers about how they used their positions. Everyday responsibilities provide opportunities to demonstrate honesty.",
     "Repentance Includes Taking Responsibility.\nPeople must acknowledge wrongdoing instead of continually blaming circumstances or other people.",
