     "Crowd Size Does Not Equal Spiritual Transformation.\nMany people may attend an event without applying its message. We should measure growth by sincere response and changed conduct, not attendance alone.",
     "Each Person Must Make a Personal Response.\nPeople could hear John together, but repentance could not be performed on someone else's behalf.",
