     "Repentance Requires Continued Faithfulness.\nA sincere response is not limited to a single public moment. It should influence a person's decisions after the moment has passed.",
     "Understand Scripture Within Its Context.\nJohn's baptism belonged to his preparatory ministry. Careful Bible study distinguishes it from later New Testament descriptions of Christian baptism.",
     "Public Commitment Should Be Matched by Private Integrity.\nPeople may make visible declarations of faith, but their everyday conduct should reflect their commitment."
