     "Power Must Never Become a Tool of Exploitation.\nJohn warned soldiers against extortion and false accusations. Authority should protect responsibility and justice, not create opportunities for abuse.",
     "Repentance Should Be Practical.\nJohn gave different instructions to people in different circumstances. A sincere response to God should influence the specific choices we face.",
     "Growth Requires Consistent Decisions.\nRepentance is not simply a declaration. It is reflected in repeated choices to reject wrongdoing and practise what is right."
