     "Understanding Context Matters\nJesus quoted Deuteronomy 8:3 in a way that directly addressed the situation. Believers should seek to understand what Scripture means rather than using isolated phrases carelessly.",
     "The Word Must Be Applied, Not Merely Quoted\nKnowing biblical language is not the same as obeying God. Scripture should influence our decisions, conduct, and attitudes.",
