     "Do Not Judge Everything by First Impressions\nNathanael's question reflected an expectation about Nazareth. First impressions can be incomplete, and careful investigation can correct mistaken assumptions.",
     "Allow Honest Questions\nNathanael expressed scepticism, but the encounter continued. Honest questions can become opportunities for deeper understanding when they are approached sincerely.",
     "Personal Encounter Can Transform Understanding\nNathanael's view changed as he encountered Jesus. Learning about Christ should lead beyond second-hand information toward a deeper understanding of who He is."
