     "text": "1. Why did Jesus enter Simon's boat in Luke 5?\n2. What did Simon say about the fishing effort during the night?\n3. What happened when the fishermen followed Jesus' instruction?\n4. How did Jesus respond to Simon's fear?\n5. Explain the meaning of the fishermen forsaking all and following Jesus in the context of Luke 5:1–11."
