     "Mercy Should Not Be Replaced by Self-Righteousness\nJesus challenged the attitude that separated people into those considered worthy and those dismissed as unworthy. Believers should practise truth with humility and mercy.",
     "Grace Invites Transformation\nJesus' welcome to sinners was connected with His call to repentance. Grace is not permission to remain unchanged; it opens the way to a transformed life.",
     "Respond to the Call Rather Than Merely Admiring It\nMatthew rose and followed Jesus. Hearing an invitation to change is only the beginning; a genuine response requires action."
