     "Service Depends on Christ's Authority\nThe disciples received a commission from Jesus. Christian service should remain accountable to His teachings and purposes.",
     "Different People May Have Different Responsibilities\nJesus gave the Twelve a particular mission. Believers should identify their responsibilities without assuming that every person's role must be identical.",
     "The Goal Is to Help Others Become Disciples\nThe Great Commission emphasises making disciples and teaching obedience to Jesus. Christian service should help people grow in faith rather than make them dependent on the personality of a leader."
