     "Religious Language Is Not a Substitute for Obedience. Calling Jesus Lord must be accompanied by a life that takes His teaching seriously.",
     "Build on a Secure Foundation. Hearing Jesus' words is not enough; put them into practice through daily decisions.",
     "Prepare for Difficult Seasons Through Faithful Living. A life shaped by truth, integrity, wisdom, and obedience has a stronger foundation when challenges arise."
