     "Faithfulness Matters More Than Comparison: People have different starting points. We should focus on responsible service rather than envy.",
     "Do Not Allow Fear to Become an Excuse for Inaction: Wise caution is valuable, but persistent avoidance can prevent us from fulfilling our responsibilities.",
     "Work With Integrity and Diligence: Faithful stewardship includes honesty, effort, learning, and responsible decision-making.",
     "Remember That Accountability Matters: Jesus' parable calls His followers to live responsibly rather than assuming that entrusted opportunities can be neglected without consequence."
