     "How can comparing yourself with others distract you from your own responsibilities?",
     "What is the difference between wise caution and fear that prevents responsible action?",
     "How can you develop a skill or use a resource to serve other people?",
     "What would faithful stewardship look like in your studies, work, relationships, or community?"
