     "Surrender May Occur in Difficult Circumstances: Jesus submitted to the Father's will even though the suffering ahead was real.",
     "Prayer Strengthens Spiritual Readiness: Jesus told His disciples to pray so that they would not enter into temptation.",
     "Prayer Is Not a Guarantee of Immediate Relief: Sometimes prayer accompanies believers through suffering rather than removing the circumstance they face."
