     "Restoration Can Renew Daily Life: After her recovery, Peter's mother-in-law rose and served. The account highlights the return of ordinary activity following healing.",
     "People in Suffering Deserve Attention: Jesus welcomed people who were sick and afflicted rather than treating their needs as unimportant.",
