     "As Jesus came down from the mountain, large crowds followed Him. Among those who approached Him was a man suffering from leprosy.",
     "In the biblical world, conditions described as leprosy could lead to severe social and religious exclusion. The relevant biblical laws required people with certain skin conditions to undergo examination and follow procedures concerning ritual cleanness.",
