     "text": "1. Which city did Jesus enter in Luke 19:1?\n2. What was Jesus doing as He entered the city?\n3. In which direction was Jesus travelling during this stage of His ministry?\n4. Who had Jesus encountered shortly before the account of Zacchaeus?\n5. What does the setting introduce about Jesus’ willingness to engage individuals during His journey?"
