     "Our behaviour can affect another person’s opportunity to learn.\nCommunities should consider whether their attitudes and actions help or hinder those seeking Jesus.",
     "Humility can help us move beyond embarrassment.\nZacchaeus was willing to take an unusual step rather than protect his public image.",
     "Look for constructive responses to difficult situations.\nInstead of focusing only on what prevented him from seeing Jesus, Zacchaeus considered what he could do next."
