     "The religious leaders were responsible for interpreting and teaching the Law of Moses. They should have approached matters of wrongdoing with seriousness, fairness, and respect for the requirements of justice. Yet the following verses reveal that their intention was not simply to seek a just resolution. They wanted to test Jesus so they could find grounds to accuse Him.",
