     "Do not measure service only by public recognition.\nMany valuable acts of service happen without an audience. We should serve faithfully whether or not others notice.",
     "Follow Jesus’ example of humble service.\nJohn 13 demonstrates that Jesus valued serving others. Our discipleship should include practical care rather than only words and knowledge.",
     "Let love shape your priorities.\nThe woman gave her attention to Jesus. We should examine whether our time, energy, and resources reflect the things we claim to value."
