    "assignment": {
     "title": null,
     "text": "1. What answer did Simon give to Jesus’ question about the debtors?\n2. What connection did Jesus make between forgiveness and love?\n3. Why should the parable not be interpreted as an invitation to accumulate or exaggerate sin?\n4. According to 1 John 4:19, why do believers love God?\n5. How should an understanding of grace influence Christian conduct?"
    }
