     "What is the difference between trusting God and relying on personal achievements to earn His acceptance?",
     "How should good works follow from a life shaped by grace?",
     "What questions does this encounter raise about the identity and authority of Jesus?",
     "How can faith in God’s forgiveness help you pursue peace while continuing to grow?"
