     "These expressions have received different interpretations within Christian traditions. In the biblical world, keys could represent authority or responsibility, and the language of binding and loosing was associated with decisions concerning what was permitted or forbidden. The passage therefore points to an important responsibility connected with the Kingdom and the community Jesus was establishing.",
