     "This is an important feature of faith. We may have questions about circumstances we cannot control, and we may not know what will happen next. Yet the central question remains whether we trust Jesus and receive His words.",
     "Jesus did not merely offer Martha an explanation for her brother’s death. He revealed something about Himself that would reshape her understanding of life, death, and hope.",
