     "text": "1. What feast was approaching when the disciples asked Jesus about the meal?\n2. Which Old Testament chapter describes the institution of the Passover?\n3. What did Jesus instruct His disciples to do in preparation for the meal?\n4. What did the disciples do after receiving His instructions?\n5. Name three ways practical preparation can support Christian ministry."
